<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\endorphin.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\肉まん目の前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>I slowly touched the meat bun with a finger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
Whoa, 
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
it's really hot...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even just holding it is hard...!<PG>
The other contestants were picking up their meat buns plate and all and <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="かじ">biting</STYLE> into them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="かじ">bit</STYLE> into my meat bun the same way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\肉まん割る.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And piping-hot soup came spurting out from inside.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A scream with no voice escaped me before I could stop it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is less a meat bun and more a big xiaolongbao.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Food that's harder to eat than I expected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And just then,<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\予選スタジオ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Champion Minamizaki-san has already finished one!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No way! I've only taken one bite...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to study the way she ate, but from here I couldn't see the champion.<PG>
"Call after call for more! As expected, everyone here seems well used to battle!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this rate, forget qualifying, I won't even squeeze into the top half...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow bearing the heat, I forced the first one into my mouth.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\肉まん目の前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Without a moment's <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="い">pause</STYLE>, the second meat bun slid in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The time it took to eat one: 2 minutes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that rate I could only eat 15 in 30 minutes, just 3 kilos...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The champion had already finished four.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I don't change my plan, getting through the qualifier is a pipe dream!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\肉まん割る.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
My one saving grace was that these meat buns were truly delicious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The soup was light and yet had real depth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the wrapper and the filling both had perfect salt, seasoning and texture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if I eat too slowly, none of that means anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something... is there something I can use?<PG>
What jumped out at me was the knife and fork lying beside the plate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's it!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\予選スタジオ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I put the knife into the meat bun and cut it in two.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hot soup spilled out from inside.<PG>
Okay, this way I can cool it fast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The same way I'd eaten yesterday's steak, I cut the wrapper and brought it to my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="そしゃく">chewing</STYLE> the wrapper, I mashed the filling with the fork, increasing its surface area so it would cool faster.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, the moment I swallowed the wrapper, I picked up the plate and poured the leftover soup and filling into my mouth together.<PG>
The time it took to eat the second one: about 50 seconds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still not up to the champion's pace, but it's a huge jump in speed all the same!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yesterday's steak battle wasn't wasted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's the same as cutting the meat while <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="そしゃく">chewing</STYLE> and washing it down with the soup.<PG>
When I looked around, at some point everyone had started eating the same way I was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Proof that this way of eating works.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll stick with this plan for a while and see how it goes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How things stand at the other tables should be announced as we go.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―10 minutes elapsed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd eaten eight, 1600 grams.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A little behind my target pace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The champion, meanwhile, was already at 12.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was already 1.5 times ahead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How is <STYLE ID="5">Chigaya-san</STYLE> doing?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\予選スタジオ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, and now <STYLE ID="5">Chigaya Niimura</STYLE>-san has finished 11!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She seemed to be doing fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I had fallen well behind the two of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How many people could there be between <STYLE ID="6">second-place</STYLE> <STYLE ID="5">Chigaya-san</STYLE> and me?<PG>
Even so, even with this knife-and-fork plan, hot was still hot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no time to cool them enough, so I was putting them in my mouth at the very limit of the heat I could eat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this going on for a full 10 minutes, the inside of my mouth finally started to sting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
20 minutes left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Can I keep fighting like this?<PG>
But the others' hands were starting to stop.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For an ordinary stomach, this much was probably the limit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My stomach was in no trouble at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But since this called for a somewhat different technique from yesterday, I could hardly say I was putting up a good fight.<PG>
Until now I'd thought that in competitive eating, you could win as long as your stomach was strong, but it's not that easy after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Calculate carefully, think about pace, and work out how to get the upper hand over the other contestants.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's no different from a sport anymore. The world's only sport where your internal organs do the fighting.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―20 minutes elapsed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So far, 16 finished, 3200 grams.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\予選スタジオ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The hands around me had stopped completely, and everyone at my table was quietly watching me.<PG>
"Champion Minamizaki-san has finished 20!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's been a four-bun gap the whole time, but that means I'm keeping the champion's pace. It can't be bad at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Chigaya-san</STYLE> is probably at around 18.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'm not inside the qualifying line soon, it'll be tough.<PG>
"At the 20-minute mark, five people still have their hands moving!
{PAUSE ""}
　In first place, Champion Minamizaki-san with 20. 
{PAUSE ""}
In second place, <STYLE ID="5">Chigaya Niimura-san</STYLE> with 19. 
{PAUSE ""}
Tied for third and fourth with 18 are <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="たかの">Takano</STYLE>-san and <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ふじしろ">Fujishiro</STYLE>-san!
{PAUSE ""}
　And in fifth place, <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> with 16. 
{PAUSE ""}
The three seats in the final will likely be fought over by these five!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a tough fight after all...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though my stomach's still fine... it's so frustrating...!<PG>
But if the champion and I are at the same pace, then everyone else's pace must have dropped below mine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Better not to think too hard here and keep going with the same plan as before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I first predicted, I put the qualifying line at 25 buns, 5 kilos.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't lose the pace, and eat with 25 as the target!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―5 minutes remaining.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\肉まん割る.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Now it is anyone's game!
{PAUSE ""}
　In first place, the champion, Minamizaki-san, with 22, 
{PAUSE ""}
in second, <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-san</STYLE> with 21, 
{PAUSE ""}
in third and fourth, as before, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="たかの">Takano</STYLE>-san and <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ふじしろ">Fujishiro</STYLE>-san with 20. 
{PAUSE ""}
And in fifth, <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> with 19!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One away from the qualifying line.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The gap was closing fast!<PG>
"Oh, and here the hands of third-place <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ふじしろ">Fujishiro</STYLE>-san have stopped!
{PAUSE ""}
　Over 4 kilos of pork buns already down, but can that lead hold to the end!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this point, it seemed to have become a battle of stomach capacity.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My stomach still had no bottom in sight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either the other one in third, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="たかの">Takano</STYLE>-san, stops, or my pace pulls ahead.<PG>
Still, the inside of my mouth was nearing its limit too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However tasty they were, I was getting sick of the flavor, and the lining of my mouth was in tatters from the heat and the salt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My pace had clearly dropped as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right... time to take an all-or-nothing gamble.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\肉まん目の前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I finished my 20th, and the 21st was set down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as before, I cut the meat bun and crushed the filling with the back of the fork.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\予選スタジオ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah, and here <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san's</STYLE> hands have stopped too!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, this was where I set down the knife and fork.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My pace over these 5 minutes had been about 2 minutes per bun.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So to be sure of a comeback here, this was the only way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I blew on the crushed meat bun again and again.<PG>
This is my final plan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Spend one minute cooling the meat bun as far as it will go, then, ideally within 15 seconds, force the cooled bun into my mouth and wash it down with water in one go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If this works, it should save a huge amount of time...!<PG>
"4 minutes remaining!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shoved half of the crushed meat bun into my mouth and washed it down with water.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment it reached my esophagus, I forced the other half in too and washed that down with more water.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That should have saved at least 20 seconds per bun...!<PG>
But my esophagus bulged wide, and I could feel my <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="えんげ">swallowing</STYLE> muscles being worked harder than ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a moment it jammed up just short of my stomach, but somehow it made it through the cardia.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just hold out for 4 more minutes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\肉まん目の前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The next meat bun set down, I cut in half the same way, mashed the filling with the fork, and blew on it for one minute.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By the second one, my head was swimming from lack of oxygen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if I give up over something like that...!<PG>
My throat, my esophagus, my <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="えんげ">swallowing</STYLE> muscles: I <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="むち">whipped</STYLE> them on, worked my diaphragm and filled my lungs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With every organ and passage in me mobilized, I held on with my eyes wide open.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Please! Just hold out a little longer! My body!<PG>
"The match is nearly over!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't collapse here!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Blow!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="か">Chew</STYLE>!
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
　Swallow!
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
　Make it through, no matter what!<PG>
"3!
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
　2!
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
　1!
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ドラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
　Tiiiime!!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\予選スタジオ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\拍手.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The long, long 30-minute battle was over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put down the knife and fork and let out a big breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd done everything I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "2000" "PASS"}
I'd carried out every plan I could think of.<PG>
But I'd been so desperately blowing and wolfing them down that I hadn't even had room to count how many I'd eaten.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All that's left now is what answer the results give.<PG>
"In first place, the champion, Minamizaki-san, 26!
{PAUSE ""}
　In second place, <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-san</STYLE>, 25!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\拍手.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Each time a name was called, applause rang out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
